The aggregate proof and the isolated `loop-invariant` claim both close with exit 0 and `#Top`. The isolated entry claim is still running because selecting it removes the helper circularity from the selected claim set; I’m allowing a bounded diagnostic run, while the aggregate invocation remains the authoritative proof command because it proves both claims together.
